{"3705770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SLIDEFORCE", "steam_appid": 3705770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fusion of fast-paced movement and first person shooting. This is <strong>SLIDEFORCE</strong>, where sliding is the key to success. Shoot down the enemies on the way, while also keeping your momentum and get the fastest time you can in a cyberpunk setting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST-PACED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The movement you've been looking for this entire time. This is <strong>that game</strong>. Manoeuvre on 10+  levels and get the fastest time you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705770/extras/e928df614fa747d5b51a2ce0c919c0d2.poster.avif?t=1767994160\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705770/extras/e928df614fa747d5b51a2ce0c919c0d2.webm?t=1767994160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705770/extras/e928df614fa747d5b51a2ce0c919c0d2.mp4?t=1767994160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EPIC GUN FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who doesn't love guns? Especially when it's combined with sick explosions, and realistic screen shake? I gotcha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705770/extras/731bf92b86aaf6600ee638f050978a39.poster.avif?t=1767994160\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705770/extras/731bf92b86aaf6600ee638f050978a39.webm?t=1767994160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so